6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I'll look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll review the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
