25,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Previous trials show that call-backs actually reduced readmissions for the elderly, but our data agreements with outside surgeries are incredibly slow to finalize.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Our physical infrastructure is at capacity; parking and rooms are full by midday, and the booking system ignores any work without a fixed slot.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Joint ventures between departments have failed due to budget disputes, and shared nursing rounds are often disrupted by external access issues.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"We have a serious shortage of ward nurses, but interestingly, the midwifery rota has some unusual slack due to falling birth numbers.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Our development budget has shrunk by a quarter, and we only earn regional tariffs for sessions held on-site, not for community outreach.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if outreach doesn't earn tariffs, we must be careful about any program that moves staff away from the hospital.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, the booking system issue is also a risk; if the work isn't a ""slot,"" the hospital won't even see the value.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, the midwifery slack is a rare opportunity, provided we don't repeat the mistakes of previous joint clinics.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I agree! We should find something that uses available staff without adding pressure to the exhausted ward nurses.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Servas,,It is a delicate balance. We must seek a path that is financially sustainable and does not overstretch our weary souls.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, does the parking shortage affect all outpatients, or just specific clinics?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,It is a general saturation. Any program increasing on-site traffic will likely seize up the access roads.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, the budget cut means we cannot afford a program that requires expensive new floor space or fitting out.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, if the call-back trial worked, maybe we can find a way to do that without needing new agreements?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, your point is well-taken. We must prioritize efficiency over expansion.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
